EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Your account is past due {!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c}. Are you in the position to get any of this caught up at this time?



We can run as a lump sum or split up the balance to run on days of your choice. Please let us know which you prefer.



Note: Please respond directly to this email and do not remove any of the contents.


Thank you,

{!Case.OwnerFullName} | {!Case.OwnerTitle}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}
E: {!Case.OwnerEmail}

